# Capture transport.
#
# Bulk source files pass THROUGH inbox/ on their way to being read; they
# never take up residence. The passages you keep live in
# sources/<slug>/raw.md as text. The original belongs in your library,
# outside this repo — binaries are undiffable and stay in git history
# forever once committed.
#
# Need to track one of these deliberately? git add -f <file>

*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw3
*.djvu

*.html
*.htm
*.mhtml
*.docx
*.odt
*.rtf

*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.m4a

# Editor and OS cruft
.obsidian/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.*.swp
